\subsection{Compound Indices}

The ordered pairs $\left(  j,k\right)  $ can be expressed as a single index
$J\left(  j,k\right)  ,$where the transformation is
\begin{equation}
J\left(  j,k\right)  =2r\left(  j-1\right)  -j\left(  j+1\right)  /2+k;1\leq
j<k\leq2r.
\end{equation}
